[96.491287, "o", "+Previously the cursor only stored ``created_at``.  When multiple orders share the same timestamp (common because timestamps are second‑resolution) the next page used ``created_at < ?`` and inadvertently skipped the remaining rows with that timestamp.  This caused missing orders during exports and API walks.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
