[96.491497, "o", "> "]
[96.492528, "o", "+The fix stores **both** ``created_at`` and ``id`` in the cursor and updates the SQL to respect the full ordering, eliminating the gap.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[96.492577, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[96.492606, "o", "> "]
[96.492646, "o", "+\"\"\"\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
