[135.673131, "o", "+PERF-87). A keyset page starts right after the last row the client has seen,\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[135.673174, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[135.673427, "o", "+so performance is constant regardless of depth and the result set does not\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[135.673482, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[135.673577, "o", "+shift when new rows are inserted.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
